Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ring carries my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From Sniper Island far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just humor the poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has too much pride to\Nshow his face to the crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he still wants to rescue his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one knows what secret I'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, long as he stops singing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.84,0:01:53.38,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(727,0)\3c&H000000&\c&HE6E5E7&\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\fscx125\fscy125\t(685,727,\1a&H00&)\pos(960,740)}Ramen Kenpo
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.84,0:01:53.38,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(727,0)\c&HE6E5E7&\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\pos(960,740)}Ramen Kenpo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's start the meeting\Nfor Operation Rescue Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've never met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you two have any questions about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the car you were\Nin was car number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means that we've got five more left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like, where's Sniper Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't know which\None of those Robin is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is, it's in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by the way, are you strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm super strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even stronger than usual this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the point is to rescue\NRobin, not beat the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're up against a lot of\NMarines in a narrow space,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we gotta make sure\Nwe don't get surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should avoid as many fights as we can\Nand whittle down the main force in turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now I'm ready for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you play innocent\Nwith me, immoral girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame changing your\Nclothes out here in front of everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shame is overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The train only has one car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cover up your legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cover up your stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for you two square-hand sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People like you are corrupting society!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, you're just too shy. Shy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid black shorts with\Ntheir stupid tiny pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't put meat in your pants, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think you\Nmight actually pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly seem riled\Nup, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those jerks got away with Robin last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that I know what's going\Non, they don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right, because if\Nyou get stuck in something again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to have hell to pay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, don't worry. I got a reason to\Nbeat them this time around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.52,0:03:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey did you Change your weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami oh no it's pretty much the same\None as before Usopp just improved it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:04:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with some dials after we got back from\NSkypea this is The perfect climate act?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see so that's his right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Usopp's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get all sad now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An intruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.90,0:04:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not feasible to board the\NPuffing Tom while it's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there really is an intruder,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means we let him sneak\Non board before we departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you can't get on while the train\Nis moving, you can't get off either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the intruder, as well as the\Nmissing prisoners, are still here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to find them. Yes, sir.
