Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone, I don't think there's\Nany room for someone to hide in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.44,0:05:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were right outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found three suspicious men,\Nincluding the criminals in Car 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corner and capture them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever use a hammer before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure do suck. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in resisting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the door already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna break through! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found the intruder in car seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The criminals do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let the guys in car three know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Franky guy's in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move in and capture them alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it! Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're shooting at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little help would be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot blindly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want these guys dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Captain T-Bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate crooked men and crooked swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes my right-angle flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonsoir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're at the end of the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone get back to the\Nfront cars right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They tricked us. huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door's blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cars are detached.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the Sea Kings for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fare thee well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's two cars down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should cut the small fries\Ndown by about 50 or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But aren't Luffy and the others\Ncoming on the same railway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens when the\Ncars run into each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, they'll come up with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You arrogant thugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.50,0:08:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear this door\Ndown in you with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, going for a swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna suffer for that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will poor Captain T-Bone do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, report this to CP9!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, more of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Freight has for T!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunpowder Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavyweight shot, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the gun working on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, guess I forgot to\Ntell you. I'm a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are real? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got steel and weapons\Nbuilt right into my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still kind of hurts if I get shot,\Nand I might bleed a little too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when you think you've seen\Nit all, the world's a crazy place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.22,0:10:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell was that for? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can deflect bullets, but needles hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one, I'm not your science\Nexperiment, so stop poking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for two, just so you know, my back\Nisn't the same as my front, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to do the operation on myself,\Nso I couldn't reach around behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, only the\Nfront side is cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I'm at it, let me tell\Nyou another little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My belly's always cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guess why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I got my own personal\Nfridge in there to keep my cola cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's got to be great in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the cola thing is really neat,\Nbut we don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get moving to the next car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is number four.
