Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.93,0:11:04.73,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(480,483)\fscx180\fscy180\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,640)\b600}Wanze\NFighting Cook, CP7
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, you guys? Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about some ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the head steward of this train,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can cook anything you\Nfellas would like to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ramen it is, but before I\Nstart, a little trivia for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nose hairs are shaped like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They crisscross inside, so they\Nlook just like fishnet stockings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I grab the flour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ant feet in...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.08,0:11:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here... Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we've got someone\Nwaiting on us, Wanze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to enjoy that\Nnose ramen on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to defeat me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can stop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an important escort mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they've got an important guy\Nlike me to keep the train safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to rescue\Nthat friend of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then first you'll have\Nto defeat my Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, keep gambling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little turd is making fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's annoying, but\Nyou gotta keep your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was my idiot imitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it dumb enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:13:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dude got ants in his pants or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear that I crazed him\Nwith one of those shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought my heart was going\Nto leap out of my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made that same stupid\Nface for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take this guy down.\NJust watch. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let this clown\Nget under your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got more important things to\Ndo than sit here and play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay back and I'll\Nmake short work of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your deal is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you were a real chef, you'd conduct\Nyourself with a little more dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take your\Nown advice for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He dodged that kick without even blinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he even looks happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making that damn face!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do the same joke twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, this guy is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you two later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying the rear\Ntwo cars were detached?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you allow something\Nlike this to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in our defense, even Captain T-Bone\Ngot trapped in one of those cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you know how powerful he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.67,0:14:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a status report on\Nwhat's left of the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of now, in addition to the engine\Nroom, there are five cars still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the military in the\Nfifth car have been taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That leaves Wanze guarding the fourth car?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nero on duty in the third car!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin up in the first car?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and everyone here in the second car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems our enemy is\Nnot to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the only\Nproblem that concerns me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In our current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that Franky is walking\Naround this train free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our mission was to take\NFranky and Nico Robin into
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,custody and then deliver\Nthem securely to Eni's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we accomplish that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many men we lose\Nor how we take care of our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has no bearing on our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And were you able to\Nidentify the intruders? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First there were the two\Nmen that we had in custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now it seems one of those two is\Nwearing some sort of strange mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's also a blonde guy in a\Nsuit that we've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making a total of three intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably a member of the Straw Hat\NPirates just like that long-nosed man is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naturally, their purpose\Nhere is to rescue Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, since they freed him,\NFrankie's decided to help them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lucci, would you like me to\Ngo and keep an eye on Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay focused on recapturing Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing else matters to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they want to take\NNico Robin back, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to break it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's just not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.38,0:16:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting the heck out of the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna bring out\Nthe ramen noodles again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen beans!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head over to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave it to you then, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose that's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the person waiting\Nfor them in the next car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is one tough customer, Nero!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the latest addition to\NCP9, an assassin for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing that\NNero loves to do, it's kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, flinchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.80,0:17:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo Noodle Slicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire escape lane!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did you disrespect my beautiful\Nattack, you kicked me ten times,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it was twelve times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.78,0:17:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you secretly super\Nstrong or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:17:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not really a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just super weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even my old man would say\Nsomething like that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I was simply distracted\Nby your swirling eyebrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make me dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I fell for your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you're a good fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.36,0:18:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad you look weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to\Ncall anyone weird looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that failed attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I need to prove myself, so\NI'm gonna show you something amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I was chosen\Nto escort those criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo, secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo, secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what the hell is all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my incredible edible combat uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen's polo suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret of this\Nramen kenpo technique is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,controlling the three\Nmoving noodles at will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, how dare you disgrace\Nfood like that, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My speed, my power, and\Nmy special abilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at a different level now\Nin all those areas! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If showing you isn't enough,\NI'm gonna boot it into you! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up already and get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But prepare yourself, cause I'm gonna make\Nyou eat every last one of those noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.71,0:19:58.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(482,482)\fscx160\fscy160\pos(960,640)\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\bord3\3c&H0E0E11&\b600\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\t(3818,3860,\1a&HFF&)}Nero "the Sea Weasel"\NCP9
Dialogue: 2,0:19:53.71,0:19:58.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(482,482)\fscx160\fscy160\bord0\blur0.8\pos(960,640)\b600\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\t(3818,3860,\1a&HFF&)}Nero "the Sea Weasel"\NCP9
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The officer in charge of the third car,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a four powers master,\Nand a new recruit in CP9,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sea weasel, Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I'm under\Nspecific orders not to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you being one of our\Nmost important criminals and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's one half.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what you're doing up\Nhere on the roof of this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd just waited inside,\NI would have come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how was I supposed to know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have tried to cheat\Nand skip right past this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rather cautious of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in your line of work, you always\Ngot to keep your guard up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's that\Nweird-looking thing there behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a dirty trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.14,0:21:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't call me the King of\NWater 7's underworld for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go down, Octoshoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?

